OL,3,C'Over the moon': Wedding proposal
OL,4,Ccaptured under solar eclipse
OL,6,FA Guernsey man chose a picture-perfect
OL,7,Fmoment to propose to his partner
OL,8,Fduring a partial solar eclipse.
OL,10,FAlain and Jade, both born and raised
OL,11,Fin the island, headed to Lihou
OL,12,FHeadland to watch the natural
OL,13,Fspectacle on Wednesday evening.
OL,15,FWhile Jade knew Alain had planned a
OL,16,Fspecial eclipse photo shoot, he
OL,17,Fsurprised her by popping the question.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
