OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786794515
OL,3,C'Over the moon': Wedding proposal
OL,4,Ccaptured under solar eclipse
OL,6,F"I'd only been told a couple of days
OL,7,Fago that we were going to do the photo
OL,8,Fshoot," Jade explains, "So I thought
OL,9,Fall we were going to do was get some
OL,10,Fnice photos with the eclipse.
OL,12,F"I was completely shocked. The whole
OL,13,Fexperience was fantastic, but I was
OL,14,Fover the moon that we were getting
OL,15,Fsome photos taken with the eclipse and
OL,16,Fthe sunset.
OL,18,F"It was an even more incredible
OL,19,Fexperience than I could have imagined."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
