CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786794515
OL,3,C'Over the moon': Wedding proposal
OL,4,Ccaptured under solar eclipse
OL,6,FAlain admitted he did not know how to
OL,7,Fpropose as he was "waiting for the
OL,8,Fright opportunity".
OL,10,F"I saw that my friend Ben was going to
OL,11,Fdo an eclipse photo shoot," he adds,
OL,12,F"So I thought there was no better time
OL,13,Fthan that.
OL,15,F"I think it actually went better than
OL,16,Fexpected, to be honest. I was pretty
OL,17,Fnervous that I might make a few
OL,18,Fmistakes or might let on that I was
OL,19,Fdoing it, but it all went perfectly to
OL,20,Fplan."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
