CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786794515
OL,3,C'Over the moon': Wedding proposal
OL,4,Ccaptured under solar eclipse
OL,6,FGuernsey photographer Ben Fiore says
OL,7,Fthe shoot took five days to prepare
OL,8,Fwith Alain.
OL,10,F"I was there every day pretty much,
OL,11,Fmaybe twice a day doing laps," he
OL,12,Fexplains.
OL,14,F"I'm always looking to photograph
OL,15,Fsomething different and push what's
OL,16,Fpossible creatively.
OL,18,F"Whether it's a portrait, proposal,
OL,19,Fwedding or a completely crazy idea,
OL,20,FI'm always up for trying to turn it
OL,21,Finto an image people will remember."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
